From a92c3c33bd0d79ed7672fb4393cab536e7199b78 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yuichi Kusakabe <yuichi_kusakabe@jp.honda>
Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 18:31:44 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] xen-virtual-device: distribute virtio-media with DomA's
 kernel

virtio-media's ddk_module builds against this kernel_build, but
xen_virtual_device_aarch64_external_modules had an empty srcs list, so
nothing referenced it. Without this entry the module is compiled and
then dropped: the dist stays at 41 modules and virtio-media.ko has to
be placed on the guest by hand, which is not reproducible from a build.

This group feeds merged_kernel_uapi_headers and kernel_modules_install,
so adding to it changes DomA's kernel artefacts -- that is the intent,
since the hardware-decode path needs the module inside the image the
guest boots.

The target lives in virtio-media rather than here because a ddk_module
has to be declared next to its sources; only the reference is this
repo's.

Depends-on: I64bbaa6483eb75733e00d3913107814cfea6c5b9 ("virtio-media: add a ddk_module target for DomA's kernel")
Assisted-by: Claude Code:claude-opus-5
Signed-off-by: Yuichi Kusakabe <yuichi_kusakabe@jp.honda>
Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [needs the xen_aarch64/virtio-media target that
 only this BSP's virtio-media 0001 adds]
---
 BUILD.bazel | 12 +++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 11 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/BUILD.bazel b/BUILD.bazel
index ceca6db..99015ea 100644
--- a/BUILD.bazel
+++ b/BUILD.bazel
@@ -274,7 +274,17 @@ kernel_build(
 
 kernel_module_group(
     name = "xen_virtual_device_aarch64_external_modules",
-    srcs = [],
+    srcs = [
+        # virtio-media, for the DomA hardware-decode path. Built against this
+        # kernel_build (not cuttlefish's) by the xen_aarch64/virtio-media target
+        # in //common-modules/virtio-media/driver.
+        #
+        # This group feeds merged_kernel_uapi_headers and kernel_modules_install,
+        # so adding to it CHANGES DomA's kernel artefacts -- which is the point:
+        # without it the module is built but never distributed, and it has to be
+        # placed on the guest by hand.
+        "//common-modules/virtio-media/driver:xen_aarch64/virtio-media",
+    ],
 )
 
 merged_kernel_uapi_headers(
